[118.124, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ Buttons now line up across all three cards. Cleaning up the screenshots I saved.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[118.448, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRan 1 shell command\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  ⎿  Bash(cd \"<workspace>\" && rm -rf .shots && ls -A)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.906, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I pushed the page further and checked it in headless Chrome at desktop width. The mobile check wasn't\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  conclusive.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **What changed in `pricing.html`**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Browser check:** the one real bug was the Starter card's button sitting lower than the other two. I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  fixed it, and the three buttons now line up.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Savings and currency:** each paid plan now shows what yearly billing saves, for example \"Billed $120\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  yearly · save $24\". A USD/EUR/GBP selector switches the prices, and it picks a starting currency from the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  browser locale. EUR and GBP prices are fixed numbers I chose, not converted rates.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Polish:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Metadata:** an inline favicon, Open Graph and Twitter tags, and a theme colour.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Scroll-in animation:** the comparison table, testimonial and FAQ fade in as you scroll. It's switched\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  off for reduced-motion settings, and the content stays visible if JavaScript is unavailable.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - **Enterprise row:** a \"Contact sales\" row under the plans.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Not verified**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Mobile:** the 390px screenshot looked cut off on the right, but headless Chrome appears to enforce a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  minimum window width of about 500px. I think the cut-off is a screenshot artifact, but I didn't confirm that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the page has no horizontal overflow on a real phone.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Not rendered:** I didn't view the dark theme, the lower sections, or the EUR and GBP prices.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Open Graph:** there's no preview image yet.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  There's also a `.ambition` entry in the folder that I didn't create or touch.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  ▪ Push: straight through\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[123.107, "o", "\r\n\u001b[33m⚑ Stop hook: [ambition instructions, part 1 of 4. The parts can arrive in any order: read them in part order\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m  as one text.]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ⎿  … +69 lines of instructions\u001b[0m\r\n"]
